{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.poster.avif?t=1759190368\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.webm?t=1759190368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.mp4?t=1759190368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finding a strange artifact deep within the forest, your friend has fallen gravely ill. Leave your home town and venture through <i>The Great Forest</i> as you search for a cure for your friend, in this demonstration of the upcoming action adventure game <strong>The Ballad of Bellum</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore some of the earlier areas of the world, like your hometown, a large lush forest, and a mysterious dungeon. Each location offers its own atmosphere, challenges, and hidden details to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the game's first dungeon, <i>The Ancient Tree</i>, solving puzzles, overcoming obstacles, and fighting foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the opening chapters of the game's story, meeting key characters, uncovering early mysteries, and setting the stage for the adventure ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique items that will aid you in your adventure, and offer advantages in overcoming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character\u2019s look with a range of clothing options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/extras/2e1d8f02cadeca32ceb9265283e039f3.avif?t=1759190368\" width=1170 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668160?t=1759190368","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/b03fc56915ae856be8ee043a6d3834e89a8489a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759190368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/37a78dabccc64182ad47ed9a1882e67b7f01dbd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759190368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/37a78dabccc64182ad47ed9a1882e67b7f01dbd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759190368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.poster.avif?t=1759190368\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.webm?t=1759190368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668160/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.mp4?t=1759190368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_